{"id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-ordinal-exponentiation.md","title":"序数指数递归","display":"df-ordinal-exponentiation — 序数指数递归","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","aliases":["18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","18-df-017"],"display":"df-ordinal-exponentiation — 序数指数递归","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.3.10","source_printed_pages":"31–32","source_pdf_pages":"41–42","source_correspondence":"faithful-recursive-definition","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</span><span>18-df-017</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-exponentiation — 序数指数递归"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"31–32"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"41–42"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"faithful-recursive-definition"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span>；乘法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" href=\"?note=c6b98d99fde7dfdc\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-multiplication\">18-df-ordinal-multiplication</a>，后继与极限类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{exp}\">\\(\\operatorname{exp}\\)</span> 由原书 Exercise 3.3.10 的超限递归引入，为可定义类函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^\\beta\">\\(\\alpha^\\beta\\)</span> 是兼容记号。本节点保留原书包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=0\">\\(\\alpha=0\\)</span> 的递归规定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,0)&amp;\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\operatorname{succ}(\\beta))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\cdot\\alpha,\\\\\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\lambda)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\xi),\\\\\n\\alpha^\\beta&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta)&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Ord}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,0)&amp;\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\operatorname{succ}(\\beta))\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\cdot\\alpha,\\\\\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\lambda)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\xi),\\\\\n\\alpha^\\beta&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta)&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Ord}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Exercise 3.3.10，而非原书不存在的“Definition 17”。存在唯一性来自 Theorem 3.2.7。按原书递归，零底在非零极限处的值是1（上确界包括 exp(0,0)=1）；不可未经说明替换成把 0^β 对所有 β&gt;0 置0的全域约定。书中使用底ω或2时没有此差异。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-multiplication","status":"resolved","id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}$；乘法见 [[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]，后继与极限类见 [[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}$；乘法见 [[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]，后继与极限类见 [[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{exp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha^\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,0)&\\coloneqq1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\operatorname{succ}(\\beta))\n&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\cdot\\alpha,\\\\\n\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\lambda)\n&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\xi),\\\\\n\\alpha^\\beta&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\\operatorname{exp}(\\alpha,\\beta)&\\in\\mathrm{Ord}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1857,"backlinks":[{"id":"3cb367216d9bd61d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb8e0157911ac3fc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\vec k:n\\to\\omega$；有限序数和按索引递增、左结合，空和为 0。序数运算见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。"},{"id":"f61399ef66a953f9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord},\\omega$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]；$\\omega^\\alpha$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]] 的指数类函数。"},{"id":"9fc246f88d0f85c8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"},{"id":"fdee91a683a5c7c3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$；$\\omega^\\beta$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]] 的序数幂。对每个固定 $\\alpha$，以下自然数递归定义唯一集合函数 $n\\mapsto\\omega_n(\\alpha)$。"},{"id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal]]，$\\omega^\\beta$ 见 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Enum}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。下列递归定义可定义类图 $\\varphi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}^3$，$\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)$ 表示其唯一值；下标与参数均为序数。"},{"id":"4104af313be51221","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。"},{"id":"58edb65d7d47e0c1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；序数加、乘、幂见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\varphi$ 与 $\\Gamma_0$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"5473eae254230968","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 严格取 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的原书系统，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。"},{"id":"1d831a9b19228b41","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；序数加、乘、幂见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\varphi$ 与 $\\Gamma_0$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"fca2fdd37fa20a53","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。"},{"id":"85ef9f58d72ef99a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的关系，$\\varphi$ 为 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]] 的 Veblen 函数，序数算术按 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]] 及其上游。另取 $\\Sigma\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{<\\omega}$，$D_{\\infty,\\eta}^{\\xi}$ 为 [[18-df-infinitary-derivability]] 的可数分支系统，其切秩按序数函数 $\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty$ 控制。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-exponentiation|18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-ordinal-exponentiation|18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","c6b98d99fde7dfdc","dbde69396a089d39"]}